{"id":"matado","lemma":"matado","pos":"adj","rank":825,"glosses":["loser, idler, poor thing","fugly, hideous (person)","bookish (lover of reading and or study)"],"ipa":"/maˈtado/","forms":{"feminine":"matada","masculinePlural":"matados","femininePlural":"matadas"},"formAudio":{"matada":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rub%C3%BD%C3%B1-matada.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nadie me ha matado aún.","en":"Nobody's killed me yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460541"},{"text":"Los animales debían ser matados.","en":"The animals had to be killed."},{"text":"¿Alguna vez has matado a alguien?","en":"Have you ever killed a man?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333242"},{"text":"Tom no ha matado nunca a nadie.","en":"Tom has never killed anybody.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333635"},{"text":"Mi canario fue matado por un gato.","en":"My canary was killed by a cat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355300"}]}